description	"Commander Pyre

A vanguard in Gold. Custom built weaponry with high ranged and leadership potential.

^2Weaponry:
- SE-44P Blaster Pistol (3)
-- 10% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 65% Faster RoF
-- 50% Slower Mag Reload
-- Cant Be Disarmed
- F-11P Heavy Suppression Rifle (3)
-- DC Carbine
-- 50% Faster RoF
-- 25% Less Damage/FP Drain
-- Cant Be Disarmed
- T-22 Ordinance Cannon (3)
-- WESTAR-M5 With Scope
-- 60% Slower RoF
-- 20% More Damage/FP Drain/Velocity
-- Knocks Back on Hit
-- Cant Be Disarmed
- Frag Grenades (3)
- Fire Grenades (2)
- Thermal Detonator (1)

^8Powers:

- Hold Fast (Team Energize 2)

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Shield Recharge (2)
- Rally
- 10% less damage taken
- 10% less knockback given/taken

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"